<description>&lt;p&gt;Fitgharan forces now control the Mogadishu-Baidoa corridor while Laftagareen forces have seized Buurhakaba and another town in the Bay region, expanding fighting in southern Somalia. Al Shabaab detonated an IED in Mandera, injuring six civilians, and the ICRC treated 148 wounded after heavy combat in Baidoa. Ethiopia announced the withdrawal of more than 3,000 troops from Somalia as its own civil war intensifies and has refused to intervene in the South West State conflict. UCDP recorded 2,284 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxPbU9EcDJQTnRNZjl6cnpwQ0sxSVRWc2NrTV9laF9mcEU4YjE4anpTcW0xclgyTlBCbnZYZ1JQY1hzSjRrdHo3RHRSVFJ4Nl80dmRMUkQta042cXpQcjNPU1pKSU10a1ZDQmpPOUczN2F6NGpYZGJtRUM5VDRDcU1Tb2owRTg2UV9NNmJiRnhHY0hmQk5mQk0tYUpqOHdlWnllb1FlQ2JMeFUwdEk?oc=5&quot;&gt;Somali Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikAFBVV95cUxNYWlXOUdzcHNTMXBDY0VBcFZXMzZtMEpxWk9hS0FWSlBya2V6TjdiOWZYWXFtaC1uYXlEaVpBWlZSTGc2bmppamJRbkxpd0dmNTJZWDNvM2VZeXlDS0JSbHh0ZklpYXJ4UVd4UE5yb0hPTldTV1pZSXVsb1I4VlNONC1wUHVrQkxMV2JRdWl4emw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Horseed Media&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxQempVc1lzdkJobGFxcm5RSG5kZFFoblBGRlMxTzVmc0dQZzBOUHR1bUhGUExBenJZQUNFS0VWM1VnSmtVY1k5WUhYOWhzMWVHbzJCMlAxZjdPU093c19nTVFkTk5YVTl3QjlEUkRtMkptWmhTUTNNVlVKMXk4QlJtVkkwdWFIVU42RkxUUG9hT01mUkRONXJobnlfeWd4dEc1em9pVXhOQ2s?oc=5&quot;&gt;Antiwar.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiygFBVV95cUxQbUVfM3VUcXdsQjlNT3VjOGZDcnJJajlXbzFWd2RqRUIzT1NqS2VzUENmVEJNc1hFaDJGeXNGTWtKSzdPbW1ScS1peG80Vy1wTjdLSnJ3X3FCNFZ0bnY4ajhNNW5TM